mic/driver/vendor/BlackHole-LICENSE.txt.

The audio router links Opus by Xiph.Org and contributors. Its BSD license and
patent notice are retained in mic/router/Opus-LICENSE.txt.

remote-mic-app was consulted only as an implementation reference for TIS input
source coordination and a real Fn down/up latch. No remote-mic-app code, icon
or other proprietary asset is included.
